     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><div>I was wondering if there is a way to show or hide the uiOutPut (<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">breakCont) </span>given a certain condition. </div><div><br></div><div>I tried with the code below with the <i>outputOptions</i> but it only disables the UI when generating the map.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><div>server.R</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"> output$breakCont</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$style </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;fixed&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      output$breakCont </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> textInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;nbreaks&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Enter manual intervals separated by commas&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;1,10,25,50&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)}))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    outputOptions</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;breakCont&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> suspendWhenHidden</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>ui.R</div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tmap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pageWithSidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    headerPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Mapping Tool&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      radioButtons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dat&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Select Spatial Dimension&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Country&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;nuts0&quot;</span><span style=\"col